# Color applet: Arizona, then Remove Scheme (Tab: Save Scheme is disabled for an unchanged scheme)
# and Enter (Yes) in the confirmation box: Arizona leaves CONTROL.INI [color schemes] and the combo,
# and the next scheme is selected. Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/color-remove.scn; compare in
# 16 colours (W16_COLORS=16).
# regress: W16_COLORS=16 sh tools/run-cp-test.sh "$TEST" "$OUT"
# The confirmation box checks USER's MessageBox (libw16/src/dialog.c, seg42:04F5):
# compare: color-remove/02.png 02.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: color-remove/03.png 03.png active
# ini: CONTROL.INI current color schemes=Windows Default
# ini: CONTROL.INI [color schemes] Arizona=
# ini: CONTROL.INI [color schemes] Black Leather Jacket=0,C0C0C0,FFFFFF,0,C0C0C0,0,800040,808080,FFFFFF,808080,808080,0,10E0E0E0,C0C0C0,808080,0,808080,0,FFFFFF,0,FFFFFF
sleep 400
shot shots/01.png
key enter
key down
key tab
key space
sleep 400
shot shots/02.png
key enter
sleep 400
shot shots/03.png
quit
